  "description": "My boss wasn't supposed to fall for me!\n\nAjin, the newest intern at the ritzy HU Hotel, seems to have it all: looks, intelligence, and money. But when Seolmin, the CEO, discovers that she's living in the basement of his hotel, Ajin desperately makes a deal with him to avoid getting kicked out. But this deal might change her life forever!\n\n(Source: Manta)\n\n*Note: Chapter count includes a prologue.*",
